{
  "id": "A4",
  "appendix": "A",
  "description": "Snapshot v4 (contract 1.7.0): one shop_agent and one handoff snapshot of a submitted Shop checkout. checkout_ref_hash is over input.checkout_id (the part before ?), continue_url_hash over input.continue_url (handoff only), completer_keyid is gw- + the public key of completer_seed_hex and account_key_thumbprint the RFC 7638 thumbprint of account_seed_hex's key (Appendix H). invalid lists v4 snapshots a validator refuses, one rule broken in each. coarse lists coarse(country, postal_code) of Appendix A (null: no coarse code). continue_urls lists hand-off targets a checkout of that store_site and myshopify_domain allows. currency_tables gives the version of each table: ct- + the first 16 hex of SHA-256(JCS(currencies)); the second is the kill switch's all-zero table. TEST KEY ONLY: published so every implementation can reproduce this vector; never use it for anything else.",
